Hmm, radial gradient with x radius = board.h*0.85 (~400) and y radius the same, clipped to the left half. Alpha .20 at the mower edge fading by 400px. That's a gentle left-side light. Let me do that.

Also reduce the night tint from .34 to .28 maybe. The board is quite dark; the zombie details would be hard to see. Let me set night tint .30 and storm .34.

